DTSTAMP:20260809T040754Z
DTSTART:20260810T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Emmy-winning Derek Hough and hi
	s Symphony of Dance: Encore to the Sugar Land stage. \nThe brand-new produ
	ction brings fresh\, high-energy choreography\, breathtaking stage design\
	, and Hough’s fusion of dance and music—from ballroom and tap to salsa\, h
	ip-hop\, and more to Houston. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $35. Order tic
	kets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by t
	he event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more detail
	s. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or 
	offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calen
	dar/derek-hough-in-symphony-of-dance-encore-at-smart-financial-centre/\n\n
	From 365 Things to Do in Houston
